[DEBREATE-0.7.13]
<<CTRL>>
Package: emma-02
Version: 2.00
Maintainer: Marcel van Tongeren <marcel.v.tongeren@gmail.com>
Homepage: http://www.emma02.hobby-site.com
Architecture: arm64
Priority: standard
Depends: libc6, libcurl3-gnutls, libsdl1.2debian, libcurl3 | libcurl4, libserialport0, libwxgtk3.0-gtk3-0v5|libwxgtk3.0-0v5|libwxgtk3.0-0, libwxbase3.0-gtk3-0v5|libwxbase3.0-0v5|libwxbase3.0-0
Description: Emma 02, the RCA 1802 Emulator
 Emma 02 is emulating the CDP18S020 Evaluation Kit, COMX-35, COMiX-35, Cosmac Elf, Cosmac Elf 2000, Cosmac Microtutor I, Cosmac Microtutor II, Cosmac VIP, Cosmac VIP II, Cidelsa Arcade Game Console, Conic (Apollo, Mustang, MPT-02 and M1200), Cosmicos, Cybervision 2001, EFA-Datorn, ETI-660, FRED 1, FRED 1.5, HEC1802, HUG1802, Infinite UC1800, JVIP, Macbug, Membership Card, Netronics ELF II, Oscom Nano, PECOM 32, PECOM 64, Pico/Elf V2, Quest Super Elf, RCA COSMAC Computer Game System, RCA COSMAC Development System, RCA COSMAC Microboard Computer, RCA MicroDisk Development System MS2000, RCA Microboard Computer Development System, RCA Studio II, RCA Studio III, RCA Studio IV, RCA Video Coin Arcade Console, SBC1802, Studio 2020, Telmac 1800, Telmac 2000, Telmac TMC-600, VELF, VIP2K Membership Card, VIS1802, VP3000 Interactive Data Terminal, VT1802 and Visicom COM-100

<</CTRL>>
